<title>CROATIA: Croatia May trade gap widens, Jan-May gap up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia May trade gap widens, Jan-May gap up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE   MAY   APRIL  JAN-MAY 97 JAN-MAY 96</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	-438   -306    -1,590     -1,098</p>
<p> Exports			   337    329     1,861	1,869</p>
<p> Imports			   776    635     3,451	2,967</p>
<p>NOTE -- January-May trade deficit widened after exports shrank 3.6 percent from a year ago while imports rose 16.4 percent. January-April gap totalled $1.15 billion. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
